WEBVTT

00:00:04.000 --> 00:00:08.000
Maya: Quick check-in. Can we have the weekly report ready for Friday?

00:00:08.000 --> 00:00:12.000
You: Yes. I’ll finish the first draft by Wednesday.

00:00:12.000 --> 00:00:18.000
Maya: I’ll review it Thursday, so we can share it Friday.

00:00:18.000 --> 00:00:24.000
You: Let’s use the same report template as last week.

00:00:24.000 --> 00:00:29.000
Maya: We’re still waiting for the final figures from Finance.

00:00:29.000 --> 00:00:35.000
You: I’ll follow up with Finance today and add the figures to the draft.

00:00:35.000 --> 00:00:39.000
Maya: Thanks. Finance has confirmed they’ll send them this afternoon.

00:00:39.000 --> 00:00:42.000
You: Great. Draft Wednesday, your review Thursday, and we share Friday.
